---
title: MF-02 · Candidate applies to a job (self-service)
---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor CA as Candidate
  participant FE as Web App
  participant API as JobEndpoints
  participant H as ApplyJobCommandHandler
  participant R2 as Cloudflare R2
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant AI as Mf03ScoringTrigger
  CA->>FE: Open a CV_APPLICATION job, choose a stored CV or upload a PDF
  FE->>API: POST /api/v1/jobs/{id}/apply (JWT)
  API->>H: Send(ApplyJobCommand)
  H->>DB: Check account ACTIVE, job ACTIVE, deadline, package limit, can_submit for Candidate
  alt job not open, limit reached or role not allowed
  API-->>FE: 400 / 403 with reason
  else allowed
  H->>R2: Upload new CV PDF (or use the selected CV)
  H->>DB: Same candidate already applied to this job?
  end
  alt duplicate
  H->>R2: Delete the newly uploaded CV (compensation)
  H->>DB: Submission BLOCKED_DUPLICATE, AuditLog
  API-->>FE: 409 already applied
  else first application
  H->>DB: Submission ACCEPTED (Source CANDIDATE) + Application SUBMITTED
  H->>AI: Enqueue scoring (AiMatchResult PENDING)
  API-->>FE: 201 Created, AI status PENDING
  end
